---
---

<section class="section principles-section" id="principles">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span class="section-label">Core Values</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Built on a few simple principles.</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      We built KFit because health tracking apps became subscription-heavy, bloated with ads, and unfaithful to Indian diets.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="principles-grid">
    <div class="principle-card">
      <div class="principle-number font-mono">01</div>
      <h3>Local-first by default</h3>
      <p>
        Your health records live in a private SQLite database on your device. Logging meals, workouts, and hydration requires zero internet connection.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="principle-card">
      <div class="principle-number font-mono">02</div>
      <h3>Transparent nutrition sources</h3>
      <p>
        Nutrition comes from your saved foods, curated Indian recipes and IFCT-2017 lab data first. When a dish isn't in any of them, KFit uses an AI estimate and labels it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="principle-card">
      <div class="principle-number font-mono">03</div>
      <h3>Account optional</h3>
      <p>
        Open the app and start logging immediately. No account signup, phone number verification, or profile questionnaires required before you can track.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="principle-card">
      <div class="principle-number font-mono">04</div>
      <h3>Core tracking without subscription</h3>
      <p>
        KFit core tracking is free with no subscription. Essential tracking features, macro resolution, and historical trends are never gated behind monthly paywalls.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="data-boundary-card">
    <div class="boundary-header">
      <div class="boundary-badge">Data Privacy &amp; Boundaries</div>
      <h3>What leaves your phone?</h3>
      <p>KFit is local-first by default. Your logs, food items, workouts, and body metrics stay on your physical device unless you explicitly use connected features:</p>
    </div>
    <div class="boundary-grid">
      <div class="boundary-item">
        <div class="boundary-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Cloud Sync (Optional)</h4>
          <p>Syncs your database across devices only when you sign in (hosted in AWS ap-south-1 Mumbai) with hardware-bound encryption.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="boundary-item">
        <div class="boundary-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/>
            <polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/>
            <line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>AI Features (Optional)</h4>
          <p>Meal photo scanning and conversational estimates use your own Google Gemini API key, communicating directly with Google.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="boundary-item">
        <div class="boundary-icon">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Diagnostics &amp; Crash Reports</h4>
          <p>Sent only when signed in with "Share diagnostics" enabled. Kept 30 days max. Never logs your meals, body, or notes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .principles-section {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .principles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .principle-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 32px 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    transition: border-color 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }

  .principle-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--border-hi);
    box-shadow: var(--card-hover-shadow);
  }

  .principle-number {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--apple-blue);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .principle-card h3 {
    font-size: 17.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .principle-card p {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .principle-card {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }
  }
  .data-boundary-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 36px 32px;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 40px auto 0;
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .boundary-badge {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--apple-blue);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .boundary-header h3 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .boundary-header p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  .boundary-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .boundary-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 20px;
  }

  .boundary-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--apple-blue);
    padding-top: 2px;
  }

  .boundary-item h4 {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }

  .boundary-item p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .data-boundary-card {
      padding: 24px 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
